    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Michael Pigott Auctioneer & Valuer is delighted to present for sale this lovely 3 bed semi detached property situated in the mature development of waterpark in Carrigaline.\r\n\r\nThis property comes to the market in excellent condition, having been well cared for and presented by its current owners. It has a lovely enclosed rear garden with side pedestrian access while offering excellent privacy. To the front, it overlooks a large green area and is ready for immediate occupation.  \r\n\r\nIt is ideally located in a cul-de sac position in the park and is most conveniently located, just minutes to all amenities & services in Carrigaline Town Centre. It is also just a short commute to Cork City, Cork Airport & Ringaskiddy, which is only a mere 10 minutes drive to where all the major multi-national pharmaceutical companies are situated.\r\n\r\nViewing of this ideal started home in a great location comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 4.5m x 1.94m \r\nWooden front door with glazing, wooden floor, carpet stairway, centre light. \r\n\r\nGuest WC - \r\nFully tiled wall and floor, WC, WHB, centre light. \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining - 5.37m x 3.62m \r\nModern fitted kitchen unit with integrated oven, microwave, dishwasher, electric hob with overhead extractor unit, centre light, coving, sliding door to rear garden. \r\n\r\nLiving Room - 4.55m x 3.25m \r\nWooden floor, centre light, fireplace with surround, coving, curtain pole, curtains, TV point. \r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR - \r\n\r\n\r\nLanding Area - \r\nCarpet floor, hot press unit, access to overhead attic. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.01m x 3.0m \r\nWooden floor, centre light, curtain pole, curtains, built in wardrobe unit. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.55m x 2.94m \r\nCarpet floor, centre light, curtain pole, curtains. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.31m x 2.44m \r\nCentre light. \r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.35m x 1.97m \r\nWooden floor, centre light, WC, WHB, bath unit with overhead electric shower and enclosure.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Size: 85.4 sq metres ( 919 sq ft)\r\nGas Fired Central Heating \r\nPVC double glazed windows and doors\r\nCul de sac location\r\nPrivate rear garden\r\nOverlooking green area\r\nWithin walking distance to all amenities of Carrigaline\r\nShort commute to Cork City Centre, Cork Airport and Ringaskiddy"
      },
